sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant App as React App
    participant API as Taggit API
    participant Store as Image Storage
    participant DB as Database

    U->>App: Take photo of item
    App->>Store: Upload image
    activate Store

    alt Upload succeeds
        Store-->>App: image_url
        deactivate Store
        App-->>U: Show image preview\n+ tag entry form
        U->>App: Enter name, notes,\nand select tags
        App->>API: POST /collections/:id/items\n{ name, image_url, notes, tag_ids }
        activate API
        API->>DB: INSERT item
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: item_id
        deactivate DB
        API->>DB: INSERT item_tags (item_id, tag_id) x N
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: ok
        deactivate DB
        API-->>App: 201 Created { item }
        deactivate API
        App-->>U: Item added to collection
    else Upload fails
        Store-->>App: Error
        App-->>U: Show error — retry
    end
